 the trades involving                                      `TraderType.InternalLiquidity`.","_marketIdsPath":"The path of market IDs to use for each trade action. Length should be equal                                      to `_tradersPath.length + 1`.","_minOutputAmountWei":"The minimum output amount expected to be received by the user.","_tradersPath":"The path of traders to use for each trade action. Length should be equal to                                      `_marketIdsPath.length - 1`.","_userConfig":"The user configuration for the trade. Setting the `balanceCheckFlag` to                                      `BalanceCheckFlag.From` will check that the user's `_borrowAccountNumber`                                      and `_fromAccountNumber` is non-negative after the trade."}},"dolomiteRegistry()":{"returns":{"_0":"The registry used to discover important addresses for Dolomite"}},"executeDepositIntoVault(address,uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":"The amount of the vault's underlying token to transfer.","_from":"The sender of the tokens into this vault."}},"executeWithdrawalFromVault(address,uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":"The amount of the vault's underlying token to transfer out.","_recipient":"The address to receive the withdrawal."}},"gmxBalanceOf()":{"returns":{"_0":"The amount of GMX tokens the user owns"}},"handleRewardsWithSpecificDepositAccountNumber(bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,bool,uint256)":{"params":{"_depositAccountNumberForWeth":"The account number to which the WETH tokens should be deposited if                                          the user decides to deposit them into Dolomite.","_shouldClaimEsGmx":"`true` to claim esGMX tokens from sGMX and sGLP contracts, or `false` to                                          skip.","_shouldClaimGmx":"`true` to claim GMX tokens from vGLP and vGMX vesting contracts, or                                          `false` to skip.","_shouldClaimWeth":"`true` to claim WETH tokens fee-tracking GLP/GMX contracts, or `false`                                          to skip.","_shouldDepositWethIntoDolomite":"`true` to deposit the claimed WETH tokens into the vault owner's                                          Dolomite account, or `false` to send them to the vault owner.","_shouldStakeEsGmx":"`true` to stake the claimed esGMX tokens in this vault, or `false`                                          to keep them idle in the vault. These tokens are non-transferable to the                                          vault's owner.","_shouldStakeGmx":"`true` to stake the claimed GMX tokens in this vault, or `false` to send                                          them to the vault's owner.","_shouldStakeMultiplierPoints":"`true` to stake the claimed multiplier points in this vault, or `false`                                          to skip."}},"maxGmxUnstakeAmount()":{"returns":{"_0":"The max amount of GMX tokens the user can unstake before having to unvest any paired GMX tokens for          vesting"}},"registry()":{"returns":{"_0":"The registry used to get addresses from the GMX ecosystem"}},"stakeEsGmx(uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":"The amount of esGMX to stake. This function must be called by the vault owner."}},"stakeGmx(uint256)":{"params":{"_amount":"The amount of GMX to stake. This function must be called by the vault owner."}},"swapExactInputForOutput(uint256,uint256[],uint256,uint256,(uint8,uint256,address,bytes)[],(address,uint256)[],(uint256,uint8))":{"details":"End-user function for swapping an exact amount of input for a minimum amount of output. Reverts if          `_tradeAccountNumber` is 0.","params":{"_inputAmountWei":"The input amount (in wei) to use for the initial trade action. Setting this                                      value to `uint(-1)` will use the user's full balance.","_makerAccounts":"The accounts that will be used for the maker side of the trades involving                                      `TraderType.InternalLiquidity`.","_marketIdsPath":"The path of market IDs to use for each trade action. Length should be equal                                      to `_tradersPath.length + 1`.","_minOutputAmountWei":"The minimum output amount expected to be received by the user.","_tradeAccountNumber":"The account number to use for the vault's trade. Cannot be 0.","_tradersPath":"The path of traders to use for each trade action. Length should be equal to                                      `_marketIdsPath.length - 1`.","_userConfig":"The user configuration for the trade. Setting the `balanceCheckFlag` to                                      `BalanceCheckFlag.From` will check that the user's `_tradeAccountNumber`                                      is non-negative after the trade. Setting the `balanceCheckFlag` to                                      `BalanceCheckFlag.To` has no effect."}},"swapExactInputForOutputAndRemoveCollateral(uint256,uint256,uint256[],uint256,uint256,(uint8,uint256,address,bytes)[],(address,uint256)[],(uint256,uint8))":{"details":"End-user function for removing collateral from the vault (in the case where `_marketIdsPath[last]` is          the underlying marketId) or the vault owner (in the case where `_marketIdsPath[last]` is not the          underlying marketId). Reverts if `_borrowAccountNumber` is 0 or if `_toAccountNumber` is not 0 (and          the `_marketIdsPath[0]` is the underlying). Reverts if the user has a negative balance before the swap          for `_marketIdsPath[last]`.","params":{"_borrowAccountNumber":"The account number to use for the vault's trade. Cannot be 0.","_inputAmountWei":"The input amount (in wei) to use for the initial trade action. Setting this                                      value to `uint(-1)` will use the user's full balance.","_makerAccounts":"The accounts that will be used for the maker side of the trades involving                                      `TraderType.InternalLiquidity`.","_marketIdsPath":"The path of market IDs to use for each trade acti